{"mode":"words","text":"No šejienes viss ir atkarīgs no taviem mācību mērķiem. Ja vēlies tikai saprast valodu, tad mērķis jau ir sasniegts — vienkārši turpini ar otro un trešo soli. Ja vēlies runāt, tad nāk kārta runāšanai kopā: izmanto A-B atkārtojumu, lai izvēlētos īsu teikumu, iestati ļoti lēnu ātrumu un runā līdzi ierakstam — kā korī. Tu uzreiz dzirdēsi, ja kaut kas skan citādi, un pats sevi izlabosi. To var darīt jebkur, pat tramvajā: ar austiņām tas skan kā telefonsaruna. Un, ja vēlies iemācīties rakstīt, vienkārši pieraksti tekstu teikumu pa teikumam.","words":[{"s":0,"e":80},{"s":160,"e":640},{"s":680,"e":880},{"s":907,"e":960},{"s":1013,"e":1360},{"s":1413,"e":1520},{"s":1560,"e":1760},{"s":1840,"e":2320},{"s":2360,"e":2880},{"s":3147,"e":3680},{"s":3760,"e":4080},{"s":4120,"e":4400},{"s":4460,"e":4880},{"s":4940,"e":5680},{"s":5720,"e":5840},{"s":5920,"e":6240},{"s":6280,"e":6400},{"s":6427,"e":6480},{"s":6520,"e":7040},{"s":7240,"e":7440},{"s":7467,"e":7920},{"s":7960,"e":8240},{"s":8267,"e":8320},{"s":8384,"e":8640},{"s":8693,"e":8800},{"s":8840,"e":9320},{"s":9370,"e":9680},{"s":10000,"e":10640},{"s":10720,"e":11120},{"s":11180,"e":11920},{"s":12000,"e":12240},{"s":12280,"e":12560},{"s":12600,"e":12960},{"s":13000,"e":13440},{"s":13540,"e":14080},{"s":14347,"e":15200},{"s":15320,"e":15760},{"s":15813,"e":16960},{"s":17000,"e":17120},{"s":17173,"e":17920},{"s":18160,"e":18320},{"s":18400,"e":19040},{"s":19320,"e":20000},{"s":20080,"e":20400},{"s":20480,"e":20800},{"s":21120,"e":21600},{"s":21707,"e":21920},{"s":21980,"e":22320},{"s":22360,"e":22640},{"s":22720,"e":23280},{"s":23400,"e":23520},{"s":23560,"e":23680},{"s":23760,"e":24240},{"s":24560,"e":25200},{"s":25253,"e":25680},{"s":25707,"e":26560},{"s":26587,"e":26640},{"s":26680,"e":26880},{"s":26920,"e":27040},{"s":27093,"e":27280},{"s":27360,"e":28160},{"s":28213,"e":28320},{"s":28400,"e":28640},{"s":28667,"e":28800},{"s":28853,"e":29520},{"s":29813,"e":30400},{"s":30440,"e":30560},{"s":30600,"e":3